atrix.json), not a step number of the UAT document.</small></p></div><p><b>Environment: dev</b> — dev deployment, build <code>e02167f</code> (Deploy Convex, 2026-10-12T18:24:27Z); account and address are not written into the report; run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>.</p><p><b>Test method:</b> PERF · Performance timing; secondary: AICHECK · AI output check — as classified in cases/test-methods.json, which says it runs on both; Source: <code>dev</code>.</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-15 Ask AI · <b>Section:</b> A3 · Encounter · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-15/S18</p><p><b>Ask AI answer time and model, 10 calls with the labs preset</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92593 Ask AI (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U37.verdict.json</code>), unit U37. Agent: 70 turns, 458 s, $0.36.</p><p><b>Recorded (evidence only):</b></p><ul><li>s18-cp05.md: (3.9: the answering model per call (RG-MODEL), read backend/log5.json) pass: backend log5 [fn=assist.askChart].model exists</li><li>s18-cp05.md: (3.9: whether any call fell back to the backup model) pass: backend log5 [fn=assist.askChart].fellBackFrom is missing</li><li>s18-cp10.md: (3.9: the answering model per call (RG-MODEL), read backend/log10.json) pass: backend log10 [fn=assist.askChart].model exists</li><li>s18-cp10.md: (3.9: whether any call fell back to the backup model) pass: backend log10 [fn=assist.askChart].fellBackFrom is missing</li></ul><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U37 (#37, ready-for-qa, live AI (Save Note / Save &amp; Extract / Ask AI)) — Pre-Round Ask: 10 timed calls. Counts askChart rows in diagnostics:list (5, then 8); any other Ask call in the case would change the counts.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #37, U37; checked: yes): <b>Blocked → runner fix</b> — 7/10 calls done, budget (50) ran out on dev. Same as U36 → systemic: agent-prompt.mjs now gives dev runs 1.6× steps/turns (cap 150). Re-run below</p><p><b>Checked by